      "id": "insi-02",
      "title": "Public-sector interoperability is a defensible beachhead",
      "summary": "OpenTunnel and Digikoppeling connect municipalities and public organizations to Dutch national facilities with managed trust and message standards.",
      "implication": "Keep government connectivity and standards lifecycle in a complicated-subsystem team with productized adapters.",
