      "id": "insi-03",
      "title": "Portfolio choice must not fragment control",
      "summary": "The offer spans Enable U's own OpenTunnel, Microsoft Azure Integration Services, Boomi and Broadcom Layer7.",
      "implication": "Different runtimes need one catalog, policy vocabulary, observability model and service boundary while preserving their native strengths.",
