      "id": "insi-04",
      "title": "Message-level visibility is the migration wedge",
      "summary": "Easy Integration emphasizes central control, real-time message visibility, business-key track and trace, reusable workflows and phased migration.",
      "implication": "Treat coexistence, correlation and reversible cutover as product capabilities rather than one-off project procedure.",
