      "id": "insi-05",
      "title": "Data value depends on visible governance",
      "summary": "The GGM platform combines a reusable data foundation and models with managed governance while the customer retains ownership of its data.",
      "implication": "Make catalog, lineage, quality, ownership and reusable models inseparable from ingestion and dashboards.",
      "priority": "high",
      "tags": [
